@startuml enemy_ai_states
title 敵人 AI 狀態圖

hide empty description

state Patrol
state Chase
state Attack
state Defeated
state Respawn

[*] --> Patrol

Patrol --> Chase : 玩家進入偵測範圍，can_chase = true
Chase --> Patrol : 玩家離開偵測範圍

Chase --> Attack : 玩家進入攻擊範圍，can_attack = true
Attack --> Chase : 玩家離開攻擊範圍

Patrol --> Defeated : 玩家從上方反擊成功
Chase --> Defeated : 玩家從上方反擊成功
Attack --> Defeated : 玩家從上方反擊成功

Defeated --> Respawn : respawn_timer 倒數結束
Respawn --> Patrol : 回到出生位置並恢復行動
@enduml
